{"ticker":"BAX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:36:35Z","profile":{"longName":"Baxter International Inc.","shortName":"Baxter International Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"United States","website":"https://www.baxter.com","fullTimeEmployees":37500,"marketCap":11890908160,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":11.195918,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.0241072,"pegRatio":36.68,"targetMeanPrice":27.75,"targetHighPrice":40.0,"targetLowPrice":20.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.05,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.35596,"operatingMargins":0.0756,"profitMargins":-0.06227,"totalRevenue":11610999808,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":30.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":15.73,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.17},"summary":"Baxter International Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides a portfolio of healthcare products in the United States. The company operates through three segments: Medical Products & Therapies, Healthcare Systems & Technologies, and Pharmaceuticals. It offers sterile intravenous (IV) solutions; infusion systems and devices; parenteral nutrition therapies; inhaled anesthetics; generic injectable pharmaceuticals; surgical hemostat and sealant products; advanced surgical equipment; smart bed systems; patient monitoring and diagnostic technologies; and respiratory health devices, as well as advanced equipment for the surgical space comprising operating room integration technologies, precision positioning devices, and other accessories. The company also provides specialty injectable pharmaceuticals, inhaled anesthetics, and drug compounding services. Its products are used in hospitals, nursing homes, rehabilitation centers, ambulatory surgery centers, doctors' offices, kidney dialysis centers, and patients at home under physician supervision. The company sells its products through direct sales force, independent distributors, drug wholesalers, and specialty pharmacy or other alternate site providers. It operates in Eastern Europe, the Middle East, Africa, Latin America, Asia, Western Europe, Canada, Japan, Australia, and New Zealand. Baxter International Inc. was incorporated in 193","summary_zh":"百特國際公司透過其子公司在美國提供一系列醫療保健產品。該公司透過三個部門運作：醫療產品和療法、醫療保健系統和技術以及製藥。它提供無菌靜脈注射（IV）溶液；輸液系統和裝置；腸外營養療法；吸入麻醉劑；非專利注射藥物；外科止血劑和密封劑產品；先進的手術設備；智慧床系統；患者監測和診斷技術；呼吸健康設備，以及用於手術空間的先進設備，包括手術室整合技術、精密定位設備和其他配件。該公司也提供特殊注射藥物、吸入麻醉劑和藥物配製服務。其產品用於醫院、療養院、復健中心、門診手術中心、醫生辦公室、腎臟透析中心、在醫師監督下的家庭病患。該公司透過直銷隊伍、獨立分銷商、藥品批發商、專業藥房或其他替代站點提供者銷售其產品。該公司在東歐、中東、非洲、拉丁美洲、亞洲、西歐、加拿大、日本、澳洲和紐西蘭開展業務。百特國際公司成立於 193 年","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材及用品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":24.41,"h":24.6,"l":23.8,"c":24.17,"v":14049000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":23.99,"h":24.28,"l":23.36,"c":23.54,"v":7474600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":23.54,"h":23.73,"l":23.12,"c":23.58,"v":5967800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":23.78,"h":24.59,"l":23.61,"c":24.42,"v":7373500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":24.25,"h":24.36,"l":23.79,"c":24.09,"v":5637100},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":24.09,"h":24.58,"l":24.02,"c":24.45,"v":4552100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":24.42,"h":24.63,"l":23.97,"c":23.98,"v":4466800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":23.94,"h":24.52,"l":23.9,"c":24.49,"v":4029100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":24.32,"h":24.42,"l":23.91,"c":23.99,"v":5749900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":24.01,"h":24.17,"l":23.58,"c":23.8,"v":7038000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":23.85,"h":24.09,"l":23.77,"c":23.87,"v":5747100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":23.93,"h":24.11,"l":23.1,"c":23.2,"v":5187500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":23.47,"h":23.81,"l":23.35,"c":23.69,"v":3610100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":23.71,"h":23.75,"l":23.02,"c":23.02,"v":13671600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":23.0,"h":23.06,"l":22.8,"c":22.81,"v":4954300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":22.81,"h":23.16,"l":22.75,"c":22.86,"v":4805500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":22.73,"h":22.91,"l":22.52,"c":22.56,"v":5869900},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":22.34,"h":22.43,"l":21.59,"c":21.71,"v":7394200},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":21.75,"h":22.05,"l":21.68,"c":21.98,"v":1054