5c3BhamFQNWxmTmtrNzVTbm82RXY2cnVXdlBxS096YTQ4TS1Mbw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"為什麼百特股票週四交易走低？"},{"title":"[Baxter International Q3 2026 Earnings Call] Baxter Beats With 5% Organic Growth, Raises Full-Year Sales and EPS Outlook, but Cephalosporin Exit Clouds 2027","src":"BigGo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE9mTzJjbFd5THp3bDNlczQ1WHRVTzFmeFFwVFZxbUI3SVd1eU5ublVDenVtQkFTakRmZGRIc0FDYXd4RXlaOWJtTWpoaDlLVkdWcXduS0NvYjRDU0NP?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"[百特國際 2026 年第三季財報電話會議]百特有機成長 5%，提高全年銷售額和每股收益預期，但頭孢菌素退出給 2027 年帶來陰雲"},{"title":"Earnings call transcript: Baxter beats Q3 2026 estimates but shares fall","src":"Investing.com UK","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOd0lJQ2hsTVpKS0tSb1lmdF85S2lscGVOejVTNXFwZ0VjVzNYMkJFS25QMGxuTjVWcDlSVmtjeHR3Qm9JTTVMczdoQmhBQ1FwMzB0czNVVXVzaWlnQXNlLWR5OWxYMjI3NmhlSi16Sk1Xcng5Vy14ZEc2X09NZmljUFplRHVWSjdyXzNFdjB2LXY1UWJPamw5SnFDSF91M1VWX3l2QzlzMzB2MF96bFJ5TFBJRkp4R00weUVrWGM0QjY0bGl1YTdOUFljM0M?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"財報電話會議紀錄：百特超出 2026 年第三季預期，但股價下跌"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":10},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/10456/000162828026007733/bax-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Baxter International Inc., through our subsidiaries, provides a broad portfolio of essential healthcare products, including sterile intravenous (IV) solutions; infusion systems and devices; parenteral nutrition therapies; inhaled anesthetics; generic injectable pharmaceuticals; surgical hemostat and sealant products; advanced surgical equipment; smart bed systems; patient monitoring and diagnostic technologies; and respiratory health devices. These products are used by hospitals, nursing homes, rehabilitation centers, ambulatory surgery centers, doctors' offices, kidney dialysis centers and patients at home under physician supervision. Our global footprint and the critical nature of our products and services play a key role in expanding access to healthcare in emerging and developed countries. As of December 31, 2025, after giving effect to the sale of our Kidney Care business (as discus","zh":"百特國際公司透過我們的子公司提供廣泛的基本醫療保健產品組合，包括無菌靜脈注射 (IV) 解決方案；輸液系統和裝置；腸外營養療法；吸入麻醉劑；非專利注射藥物；外科止血劑和密封劑產品；先進的手術設備；智慧床系統；患者監測和診斷技術；和呼吸健康設備。這些產品供醫院、療養院、復健中心、門診手術中心、醫生辦公室、腎臟透析中心和在醫生監督下在家的患者使用。我們的全球足跡以及我們產品和服務的關鍵性質在擴大新興國家和已開發國家獲得醫療保健的機會方面發揮關鍵作用。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，在出售我們的腎臟護理業務後（如討論）"},{"en":"Baxter International Inc. was incorporated under Delaware law in 1931. As used in this report, \"we\", \"our\" or \"us\" means Baxter International Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries, unless the context otherwise requires.","zh":"Baxter International Inc. 於 1931 年根據特拉華州法律成立。本報告中使用的「我們」、「我們的」是指 Baxter International Inc. 及其合併子公司，除非上下文另有要求。"},{"en":"On August 12, 2024, we entered into an Equity Purchase Agreement (EPA) with certain affiliates of Carlyle Group Inc. (Carlyle) to sell our Kidney Care business. That business, which is now known as Vantive Health LLC (Vantive) is comprised of our former Kidney Care segment. On January 31, 2025, we completed the sale of our Kidney Care business to Carlyle for an aggregate purchase price of $3.80 billion in cash, subject to certain closing cash, working capital and debt adjustments. After giving effect to certain adjustments, we received approximately $3.71 billion pre-tax cash proceeds at closing of the transaction with the net after tax proceeds of approximately $3.3 billion, prior to giving effects to certain post-closing adjustments. As of December 31, 2025, we repaid $3.81 billion of legacy indebtedness in 2025 (which repayment does not include $2.00 billion of indebtedness repaid wit","zh":"2024 年 8 月 12 日，我們與凱雷集團 (Carlyle) 的某些附屬公司簽訂了股權購買協議 (EPA)，以出售我們的腎臟護理業務。該業務現在稱為 Vantive Health LLC (Vantive)，由我們以前的腎臟護理部門組成。 2025 年 1 月 31 日，我們以 38 億美元現金的總購買價完成了向凱雷集團出售腎臟護理業務的交易，但須進行某些結算現金、營運資金和債務調整。在實施某些調整後，我們在交易結束時收到了約 37.1 億美元的稅前現金收益，在實施某些交割後調整之前，稅後淨收益約為 33 億美元。截至2025年12月31日，我們在2025年償還了38.1億美元的遺留債務（該償還額不包括20.0億美元的已償還債務）"}],"markets":[{"en":"We currently manage our global operations based on three reportable segments: Medical Products & Therapies, Healthcare Systems & Technologies and Pharmaceuticals.","zh":"我們目前根據三個可報告部門管理我們的全球業務：醫療產品和療法、醫療保健系統和技術以及製藥。"},{"en":"The Medical Products & Therapies segment includes sales of our sterile IV solutions, infusion systems, administration sets, parenteral nutrition therapies and surgical hemostat, sealant and adhesion prevention products. The Healthcare Systems & Technologies segment includes sales of our connected care solutions and collaboration tools, including smart bed systems, patient monitoring systems and diagnostic technologies, respiratory health devices and advanced equipment for the surgical space, including operating room integration technologies, precision positioning devices and other accessories. The Pharmaceuticals segment includes sales of specialty injectable pharmaceuticals, inhaled anesthetics and drug compounding services.","zh":"醫療產品和療法部門包括銷售我們的無菌靜脈注射解決方案、輸液系統、給藥套件、腸外營養療法以及手術止血劑、密封劑和預防沾黏產品。醫療保健系統和技術部門包括銷售我們的連網護理解決方案和協作工具，包括智慧床系統、病患監護系統和診斷技術、呼吸健康設備和手術室先進設備，包括手術室整合技術、精密定位設備和其他配件。藥品部門包括特種注射藥品、吸入麻醉劑的銷售及藥物配製服務。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Medical Products & Therapies","val":5299000000,"zh":"醫療產品和療法"},{"name":"Healthcare Systems & Technologies","val":3071000000,"zh":"醫療保健系統和技術"},{"name":"Pharmaceuticals","val":2493000000,"zh":"藥品"}],"total":11244000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":6122000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":5122000000,"zh":"非我們"},{"name":"Western Europe Canada Japan Australia & New Zealand","val":3728000000,"zh":"西歐 加拿大 日本 澳洲與紐西蘭"},{"name":"Eastern Europe Middle East Africa Latin America Asia","val":1394000000,"zh":"Eastern Europe Middle East Africa Latin America Asia"}],"total":11244000000}},"peers":["BDX","EW","CAH","BSX","SYK"]}}